flowchart TD
    A[User Query] --> B[Query Understanding<br/>factual / numerical / table / comparison / multi-hop]
    B --> C[Dense + Sparse Retrieval<br/>FAISS cosine + BM25]
    C --> D[Hybrid Fusion<br/>weighted (alpha=0.5) or RRF]
    D --> E[Optional Reranking<br/>cross-encoder]
    E --> F[Evidence Selection<br/>top-k, table-aware for numeric questions]
    F --> G[Grounded Context Construction]
    G --> H[Grounded Generation<br/>LLM with strict system prompt]
    H --> I[Citation Validation<br/>numeric verification + claim support]
    I --> J[Answer + Citations<br/>Page / Section / Chunk]

    E -- "low confidence" --> K[Evidence-first / insufficient-evidence answer]